    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Naureen Mushtaq, an assistant professor in oncology at the University, has secured a Sanofi Espoir Foundation My Child Matters grant which supports initiatives to boost cancer diagnosis and treatment in low-income countries around the world.",
